             CPWMAC  - used by all versions.
             CPWMBSE - used by BSEPP system only
             CPWMSP  - used by VM/SP and VM/HPO.
0     The CPWATCH libraries are maintained using VMFMAC:
        VMFMAC    CPWMAC              CPWR6
